<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n88435" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρόρρ-ησις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>prediction, prognosis,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Prog.</u>
				15
			</span></i>(pl.), <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				12.36
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plot.
				3.1.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				11.382.21
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Agath.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>previous instruction</i> or <i>warning,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				1.49
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>proclamation,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ προρρήσεως πολεμεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					9.13
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱπ.</span>
			<i>public notices,</i> as in case of trials for murder, <i><span class="en">
				Antipho
				5.88
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				6.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				873b
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν π. προαγορεύων</span>
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				871c
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> Rhet.,
				<i>introductory statement,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Rh.Al.</u>
				1438b11
			</span></i> (pl.); <i>comment given beforehand,</i> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίρρησις,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1.31S.
			</span></i></div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
